# CarFair Supabase Database Configuration
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# Paste the SQL script from supabase/schema.sql into the Supabase SQL Editor
# Then obtain your Project URL and anon key from Project Settings -> API:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
